{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":197591,"duration_api_ms":196794,"num_turns":18,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"dad27899-ec12-42c0-b829-59acf60d758f","total_cost_usd":0.9465807999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":62744,"cache_read_input_tokens":474549,"output_tokens":4909,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":62744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":11,"outputTokens":4909,"cacheReadInputTokens":474549,"cacheCreationInputTokens":62744,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7522044999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":57,"outputTokens":8574,"cacheReadInputTokens":519743,"cacheCreationInputTokens":79580,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1943763,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 17 budget tracking tests pass: test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools, test_total_c_helper_sums_all_pools, test_budget_component_labels_cover_all_element_bearing_fields, test_budget_path_rules_catch_convention_based_future_fields, test_closed_system_n_conservation, test_closed_system_c_conservation, test_periphyton_capacity_excess_routes_to_dissolved_organics, test_algae_loss_routing_is_clamped_to_available_biomass, test_plant_loss_routing_is_clamped_to_available_biomass, test_trim_plants_preserves_n_and_c_when_routed_to_detritus, test_closed_system_shrimp_mortality_conserves_n_and_c, test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c, test_water_change_n_export_tracked, test_water_change_tracks_gross_n_import_and_export, test_dissolved_oxygen_stage_tracks_gross_in_and_out, test_preset_dic_exchange_is_treated_as_open_system_carbon, test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled","All 12 cycling tests pass including nitrifier growth-source regressions: aob_growth_reserves_tan_for_assimilation_when_tan_would_otherwise_hit_zero, comammox_growth_reserves_tan_for_assimilation_when_tan_would_otherwise_hit_zero, nob_growth_uses_nitrite_source_not_ammonia","Full tank_core test suite passes (all test binaries, 0 failures)","cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings passes with zero warnings","Canonical nitrogen_budget_components (budget.rs:170) includes all 16 N-bearing pools: ammonia, nitrite, nitrate, DON, substrate_layers[*].nutrient_store_mg_n_total, 2 plant guilds, suspended algae, periphyton, decomposer/AOB/NOB/comammox biomass, adult/juvenile shrimp, particulate/fine detritus. Substrate N inclusion matches reviewer correction.","Canonical carbon_budget_components (budget.rs:268) includes all 13 C-bearing pools: DIC, DOC, plant guilds, algae, microbes, shrimp, detritus. dissolved_feed_residue explicitly excluded with documented reason (DOC/DON mirror, would double-count).","Both nitrogen_budget_components and carbon_budget_components have declaration-site doc comments (budget.rs:162-169, 260-267) documenting the naming-convention contract and obligation to update when adding new element-bearing fields.","total_nitrogen_mg() and total_carbon_mg() (budget.rs:341-353) are single canonical sources of truth, built by summing the same BudgetComponent arrays used by the structural coverage test.","TankState exposes total_nitrogen(), total_carbon(), budget_totals() (state.rs:241-251) all delegating to BudgetTotals::from_state().","Budget tracking is truly zero-cost when disabled: budget_ledger is Option<BudgetLedger> (engine.rs:26), maybe_record_stage (engine.rs:236-255) only computes BudgetSnapshot when tick.is_some(). Verified by test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled.","Runtime conservation guard (engine.rs:495-521) returns SimError::BudgetImbalance with element, delta, tick_index, day, hour for closed-system ticks exceeding 1e-6 mg tolerance.","Nitrifier growth fix verified: resolve_nitrifier_step (nitrogen_cycle.rs:410-465) jointly solves oxidation + assimilatory growth against source-N and DIC using bisection, preventing the old bug where growth collapsed because TAN was pre-debited. AOB/comammox use TAN (lines 199, 254), NOB uses nitrite (lines 302-303) as source pool. consume_live_growth_inputs_from_pool debits from the correct pool at lines 205-209 (AOB→TAN), 260-264 (comammox→TAN), 309-313 (NOB→nitrite).","Producer loss clamping verified: algae_growth.rs:117-119 clamps suspended loss to available biomass after growth; algae_growth.rs:199-201 does same for periphyton. plant_growth.rs:152-153 uses clamp_partitioned_losses to proportionally distribute available biomass between respiration and senescence.","Periphyton capacity overflow routed explicitly: algae_growth.rs:204-208 computes excess above capacity and routes it via route_algae_loss_to_dissolved_organics alongside the realized loss, preventing silent mass disappearance.","Shrimp mortality routes dead biomass to fine detritus via route_dead_shrimp_to_detritus (shrimp.rs:507-517). Shrimp hatching/maturation debits dissolved N/C pools via fund_live_shrimp_biomass_from_water (shrimp.rs:535-566), preventing mass creation.","All 6 acceptance-criteria tests from reviewer comments are present and passing: (1) test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools, (2) test_total_c_helper_sums_all_pools, (3) test_closed_system_n_conservation, (4) test_closed_system_c_conservation, (5) test_water_change_n_export_tracked, (6) test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled.","Per-stage granular recording covers all 12 PlayerAction variants (exhaustive match in action_budget_label, engine.rs:478-493) plus all system stages including temperature, nitrogen_cycle, chemistry, dissolved_oxygen, shrimp_stress, hourly_events, invariants, daily_plants, daily_algae, daily_microfauna, stability_tracker, daily_shrimp, daily_filter_clogging, daily_biofilter_maturity.","Structural coverage guard (budget_tracking.rs:304-339) serializes TankState to JSON, discovers all numeric paths matching convention-based patterns, and asserts exact equality with canonical helper component labels. Also confirms dissolved_feed_residue exclusion.","Closed-system conservation tests use active_budget_state (budget_tracking.rs:57-83) with non-zero algae, microbes, microfauna, detritus, dissolved pools, and substrate N — confirming real biological transformations occur during 24-tick simulations."],"findings_or_gaps":["The convention-based field discovery in the structural coverage test catches fields matching *_mg_n_total, *_mg_c_total, *biomass_g, and shared detritus/animal patterns. A future element-bearing field with a non-standard suffix would evade detection. This is a known, documented limitation and acceptable given Rust's lack of practical compile-time field introspection.","Shrimp eggs remain implicit (EggCohort has count and progress_days only). Mass is conserved by debiting dissolved pools on hatch/maturation, which is a sound workaround. A first-class egg biomass pool would be cleaner for save-schema clarity but is appropriately deferred.","Complex multi-process stages like nitrogen_cycle record budgets via snapshot-derived gross component deltas. Same-component turnover within a single stage pass can still net out. The explicit-budget path addresses the most important bidirectional stages (water_change, dissolved_oxygen). This is acceptable granularity for the current phase.","The test_total_n/c_helper_sums_all_pools tests use manually defined helper functions with hardcoded constants independent of library helpers, providing genuine cross-validation of the stoichiometric math.","SiphonDetritus and CleanFilter return None (no explicit BudgetDelta) and are correctly classified as open-system actions in the conservation guard (engine.rs:527-533). Their mass changes are captured by snapshot-based recording and documented in ROUTING.md as intentional exports.","Oxygen tracking is limited to dissolved_oxygen_mg_total and does not decompose O2 across biomass pools. This is consistent with the deliverable's 'track where feasible' wording and appropriate for the current phase."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"bf29e793-b244-4ba6-86f3-9425d61febb1"}
